  "descriptionMarkdown": "It’s a small, just 268 tons, normal quality only space platform which is capable of going to solar system edge and back at early late-game.\nShip is designed for an “Express delivery” achievement.\nTo reach the edge Physical projectile damage level 9 and Stronger explosives level 8 required.\nNote: It is capable to self-load, but it requires 7500 Firearm magazines and 5000 Rockets to go from Nauvis to Solar System Edge and back. And it will take you about 3 hours to prepare for the flight on Nauvis orbit.\n\nEach next level of physical projectile damage research will allow you to use ~7% less ammo.\nUsing Piercing rounds magazine is less effective as it will double you preparation time or will require 15% more rocket launches to fill the ship.",
